<div class="timer-controls mb-2" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.6rem;align-items:center;">
<label style="font-weight:600; display:flex;align-items:center;">Minutes:
              <input class="form-control" id="minutes" max="999" min="0" style="width:80px; display:inline-block; margin-left:.4rem;" type="number" value="25"/>
</label>
<label style="font-weight:600; display:flex;align-items:center;">Secondes:
              <input class="form-control" id="seconds" max="59" min="0" style="width:80px; display:inline-block; margin-left:.4rem;" type="number" value="0"/>
</label>
</div>
<div class="timer-display" id="timerDisplay">25:00</div>
<div aria-label="ContrÃ´les du minuteur" class="timer-btns" role="toolbar">
<button class="btn btn-success btn-small" id="startBtn"><i class="fa fa-play"></i> DÃ©marrer</button>
<button class="btn btn-secondary btn-small" id="pauseBtn"><i class="fa fa-pause"></i> Pause</button>
<button class="btn btn-danger btn-small" id="resetBtn"><i class="fa fa-refresh"></i> RÃ©initialiser</button>
</div>
<details class="faq-section" style="margin-top:1rem;">
<summary style="font-weight:700; font-size:1rem;">Foire aux questions</summary>
<ul style="padding-left:1.1rem; color:#374151;">
<li><b>Puis-je dÃ©finir des durÃ©es personnalisÃ©es ?</b> Oui â€” choisissez n'importe quelle pÃ©riode en minutes et secondes.</li>
<li><b>Le minuteur persiste-t-il aprÃ¨s un rechargement ?</b> Non â€” il se rÃ©initialise lorsque la page est rechargÃ©e.</li>
